===Noun===
{{en-noun|dutchmen}}

# {{context|carpentry}} A piece of wood used to repair wood or boards, shaped such that it fills as exactly as possible a [[void]] or [[cavity]] that is to be repaired.

# {{context|masonry}} A piece of stone used to repair a larger stone, shaped such that it fills as exactly as possible a [[void]] or [[cavity]] that is to be repaired.

